msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/overview.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Division of responsibility"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/overview.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer                           | Owns                                                          | Does not own                      |\n"
"| ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n"
"| `docs/ui/`                      | Product-facing norms, pattern contracts, dimension adaptation | IDE checklists, weekly tool lists |\n"
"| `.agent/rules/ui-dimensions.md` | Hard bans + API quick reference                               | Long product essays               |\n"
"| `.agent/rules/frontend-ui.md`   | Stack bans, import boundaries, composite import list          | Full visual essays                |\n"
"| `src/ui-kit/`                   | Components + CSS tokens (implementation SSOT)                 | Product architecture              |\n"
"| `docs/aspects/`                 | Cross-cutting data planes (sync, refresh, offline)            | Visual taxonomy                   |\n"
msgstr ""

